msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-paulice/guides/quickstart/extracted-outputs/add-checks-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Sample the checked circuit {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"
msgstr "3. Sampel litar yang telah disemak {#3-sample-the-checked-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before we sample, we transpile the checked circuit onto physical qubits (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) and into `ibm_boston`'s native basis gate set. To emulate a noisy QPU, we sample with a noisy Aer stabilizer backend whose error rates match the `noise_model` used to pick checks.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum membuat pensampelan, kami mentranspil litar yang telah disemak ke atas qubit fizikal (`initial_layout = layout + ancilla_qubits`) dan ke dalam set gate asas natif `ibm_boston`. Untuk meniru QPU yang bising, kami membuat pensampelan dengan backend penstabil Aer yang bising yang kadar ralatnya sepadan dengan `noise_model` yang digunakan untuk memilih semakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Postselect samples with no detected error {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"
msgstr "4. Pilih lepas sampel tanpa ralat dikesan {#4-postselect-samples-with-no-detected-error}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`get_postselection_method` maps each shot to its syndrome vector; we keep only the shots with an all-zero syndrome &mdash; those in which no check detected an error. Discarding the flagged shots removes detected errors from the surviving distribution, improving its fidelity at the cost of a lower sampling rate. See the [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) for a quantitative fidelity comparison.\n"
msgstr "`get_postselection_method` memetakan setiap tembakan kepada vektor sindrom; kami hanya mengekalkan tembakan dengan sindrom sifar sepenuhnya &mdash; iaitu tembakan yang tiada semakan mengesan ralat. Membuang tembakan yang ditandakan menyingkirkan ralat yang dikesan daripada taburan yang tinggal, sekali gus meningkatkan fidelity-nya dengan kos kadar pensampelan yang lebih rendah. Lihat [tutorial](/tutorials/spacetime-codes) untuk perbandingan fidelity secara kuantitatif.\n"
